# Publisher's real deploy config (created from wrangler.example.toml).
# wrangler.toml typically contains the route patterns for the publisher's own
# domain plus their account-id wiring; never commit it. The four committed
# wrangler.*.toml files in the repo are templates / dev scaffolding only.
wrangler.toml
webmcp.toml

# Exception: the example-site config is a checked-in fixture used by
# `npm run dev` against the bundled static origin. Not a publisher deploy.
!templates/example-site/webmcp.toml
